  "text": "Home >Resources >Data Tools > BankFind Suite\nBankFind Suite\n\nBankFind Suite is available for the public to search the FDIC’s extensive data records. BankFind Suite allows you to locate current and former FDIC-insured banking institutions by name, FDIC certificate number, website and/or by location. The Suite also allows a user to follow the history and financial trends of an individual institution, group of institutions, or the industry as a whole. Updates and improvements to functionality and data access are regularly released as the development progresses. View the release notes for past improvements.\n\nProvide feedback or submit a question about this page.\n\nFind Insured Banks\n\nReports and Comparisons\n\nSummary of Deposits\n\nBank Structure Changes\n\nAnnual Data Summaries\n\nFailures and Assistance\n\nBulk Data and API\n\nHelp Library",
